      "slug": "waistcoat-st",
      "term": "Waistcoat stitch",
      "definition": "Instead of inserting the hook under the two top loops of a stitch, insert it between the two legs (under the v-shape of the stitch head from below). The dc made this way looks like a knit stitch from above."
    },
    {
      "slug": "turning-chain",
      "term": "Turning chain",
      "definition": "One chain at the start of each waistcoat stitch row. Does not count as a stitch."
    },
    {
      "slug": "weaving-in-ends",
      "term": "Weaving in ends",
      "definition": "Threading yarn tails through stitches with the tapestry needle."
    }
